            "value": {
                "none": [
                    "This new and updated version contains over 100 pages of additional content! \n\n My bodyguard. My enemy. \nWhen my father hires Sebastian Bailey to protect me, I vow to make him quit within a week.\nHe's rude, overbearing, bossy and oh, too attractive for his own good.\nOur hate is as explosive as our chemistry.\nBut my plans backfire.\nSoon, he becomes my confidante, my friend�my lover.\nUntil the truth comes to light�too late.\nSebastian Bailey is not who he says he is.\nHe's here only for one reason.\n To ruin me. \nAnd he goes straight for the kill.\n\nFrivolous is an enemies to lovers mafia romance standalone. Please be advised that it contains a lot of sensitive themes. Read the triggers before proceeding."
